sequenceDiagram
    participant Kafka as Kafka (orderIn)
    participant Listener as MessageConsumerListener
    participant DT as DisruptorTemplate
    participant RB as RingBuffer~OrderEvent~
    participant FEH as FlatOrderEventHandler
    participant FME as FlatMatchEngine
    participant FOB as FlatOrderBook
    participant FOS as OutboundSender

    Note over Kafka,FOS: 限价单撮合（GTC 部分成交 → 剩余挂单）

    Kafka->>Listener: onOrderIn(SBE frame)
    Listener->>Listener: 校验（魔数/templateId/长度）+ 路由
    Listener->>DT: onData(frame, symbol)
    DT->>DT: memcpy 槽位 + 发布线程 SBE 解码到 fields
    DT->>RB: publish(sequence)
    RB->>FEH: onEvent(event, endOfBatch)
    FEH->>FME: onOrderIn(event.getFields(), nowMs)
    FME->>FME: 校验 / 路由（批撤 / 撤单 / 条件单）
    FME->>FOB: FlatMatchService.match → matchTaker
    FOB-->>FME: MatchFill[]（成交）
    FME->>FOS: submitFills(fills)
    Note over FEH: endOfBatch：publishDepthSnapshot + WAL 异步 flush（方案 A）
    FOS->>Kafka: 出站 SBE（trades / depth）
